        "story": "Tried asking her to go for poutine, but she shut me down.\" \"Good girl,\" they all chant. My gaze draws to Armin again. The poutine story really happened too. Was he actually doing that when we first met? My skin flushes, and the room is suddenly warmer. Obviously, we're not like that now, but how many things -- how much -- have I missed? It's an odd type of melancholy that washes over me as they all laugh around me. I think of the girl I was when I first started at the office, all the experiences and chances I've denied her.",
