        "story": "First, thank you, reader, for spending your time with these pages and for taking a chance on a debut. I appreciate you very much. To my incredible agents, Melanie Figueroa and Taylor Haggerty, for helping make my dream come true. Thank you for your infectious enthusiasm, passion, and guidance from the first call. Working with you is both magical and a pleasure. Special thanks to Jasmine Brown, Stacy Jenson, Holly Root, and everyone in the Root Lit Fam, including my talented and welcoming agent siblings. To my foreign rights agent, Heather Baror-Shapiro, and everyone behind the scenes at Baror International. To my film agent, Alice Lawson, and to Olivia Handrahan, Eren Joyce, and everyone behind the scenes at Gersh.",
